    lines.append("")
    lines.append("### Silent Share on Test Seed & Algebraic Crossover Analysis")
    lines.append("- **Actual Test Seed Silent Share**: $s = 585 / 1,449 = \\mathbf{40.37\\%}$ (585 silent, 864 non-silent).")
    lines.append("- **Recall Functions** ($s \\in [0, 1]$):")
    lines.append("  - $R_{naive}(s) = 1.0 - s$")
    lines.append("  - $R_{aerotrust}(s) = 0.2120 s + 0.4097(1 - s) = 0.4097 - 0.1977 s$")
    lines.append("  - $R_{union}(s) = 0.2120 s + 1.0(1 - s) = 1.0 - 0.7880 s$")
    lines.append("- **Precision Functions** ($N_{pos} = 1,449, N_{clean} = 3,820$):")
    lines.append("  - $P_{naive}(s) = \\frac{1449(1 - s)}{1449(1 - s) + 929}$")
    lines.append("  - $P_{aerotrust}(s) = \\frac{1449(0.4097 - 0.1977 s)}{1449(0.4097 - 0.1977 s) + 659}$")
    lines.append("  - $P_{union}(s) = \\frac{1449(1 - 0.7880 s)}{1449(1 - 0.7880 s) + 1286}$")
    lines.append("")
    lines.append("### Exact Crossover Solution (Correcting Obsolete '0.88' Statement)")
    lines.append("1. **Precision Crossover**: Setting $P_{aerotrust}(s) = P_{naive}(s) \\iff \\frac{TP_{AT}}{659} = \\frac{TP_{naive}}{929}$:")
    lines.append("   $$929(0.4097 - 0.1977 s) = 659(1 - s) \\implies 475.34 s = 278.39 \\implies \\mathbf{s = 58.57\\%}$$")
    lines.append("2. **Recall Crossover**: Setting $R_{aerotrust}(s) = R_{naive}(s)$:")
    lines.append("   $$0.4097 - 0.1977 s = 1.0 - s \\implies 0.8023 s = 0.5903 \\implies \\mathbf{s = 73.58\\%}$$")
    lines.append("3. **Correction**: The previous report stated a critical crossover of '0.88'. The exact algebraic solution proves that **AeroTrust precision overtakes Naive precision at $s = 58.6\\%$**, and **outperforms Naive in BOTH precision and recall when $s \\ge 73.6\\%$**.")
    lines.append("")
