    lines.append("**Plain Statement: No.** At the current test seed silent share ($s = 40.4\\%$), the Union achieves an F1-score of **53.08%**, which slightly trails the Naive baseline's F1-score of **53.30%** (-0.22% F1). While the Union increases recall by +8.55% (recovering 124 stealth spoofing attacks that the Naive baseline completely misses), it introduces 357 additional false positives, lowering precision from 48.19% down to 43.45%.")
    lines.append("")
